Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.03,0:00:03.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.90,0:00:06.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由佳吏你收到過和美咲的政府通知嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.25,0:00:08.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還有過這種事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.22,0:00:10.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.70,0:00:12.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還有命中注定的對象又是什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.37,0:00:15.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你到底知道些什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.79,0:00:18.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,美咲又對我隱瞞了些什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.79,0:00:21.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 你到底是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.05,0:00:27.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,即使可以不看 不聽 不說
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.59,0:00:31.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也無法停止對某人的思念
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.81,0:00:35.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,美咲她有著想要守護的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.35,0:00:38.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,即使說謊也在所不惜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.06,0:00:42.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以我要保護這樣的美咲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.28,0:00:44.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,僅此而已
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:01:01.91,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真っ赤な線を描いたちっぽけな心の話
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.92,0:01:08.25,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,僕らの未来はどこに向かって光るの
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.75,0:01:15.22,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,続きの線を描いた　色づいてしまう度にまぶしい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.34,0:01:20.68,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,そんな心のリズムを繋ぎだす
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:28.19,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,かなしいかなしいかなしいかなしい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.02,0:01:34.90,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,うれしいうれしいうれしいうれしい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.70,0:01:41.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,２つの感情に揺さぶられては
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.29,0:01:49.06,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,まだ見ぬ指先を照らし出してくだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.41,0:01:56.42,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,このまま嘘でもいいから夢泳がせて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.42,0:02:02.01,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,かなしいかなしい今を探してく
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.31,0:02:09.73,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,僕らは見えない未来を信じてる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.94,0:02:15.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,だから悲しい悲しい今を探しては光った
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.49,0:02:16.63,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,引つかた
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.75,0:02:20.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,柊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.96,0:02:23.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怎麼會在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.41,0:02:30.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個女孩是什麼 是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.29,0:02:31.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她是我的初中同學
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.29,0:02:34.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,為什麼她要對你說這些話
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.13,0:02:36.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.63,0:02:38.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和美咲的政府通知又是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.42,0:02:42.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這種事美咲沒有告訴過我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.51,0:02:44.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她並不是故意要瞞著你的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.55,0:02:46.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只是那說不定是我看錯了也說不定
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.35,0:02:51.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學也完全沒有任何反應 而且
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.03,0:02:56.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也不知道該怎麼告訴莉莉奈你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.40,0:02:58.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.32,0:03:02.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由佳吏和我收到的政府通知不一樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.24,0:03:04.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.04,0:03:11.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個 矢島先生說 我的對象就是莉莉奈沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.75,0:03:14.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.30,0:03:20.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個 抱歉 一不小心就和你普通地說話了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.63,0:03:22.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我應該先和你好好道歉的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.59,0:03:26.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沒關係 現在先暫時休戰吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.22,0:03:28.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,現在還有更重要的事要做
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.60,0:03:29.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沒 沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.18,0:03:34.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,總之 要去找那個女生問清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.98,0:03:36.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她是美咲的朋友吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.02,0:03:38.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,應該是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.28,0:03:41.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能不能去向高崎同學要她的聯絡方式呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.95,0:03:43.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 就這麼做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.03,0:03:45.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.78,0:03:48.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你半天不回來 我找了你好久
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.70,0:03:51.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉 我這邊發生了一點事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.71,0:03:53.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,話說回來 這位是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.33,0:03:57.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你就是那位拚命發傳單的男孩子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.50,0:04:02.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我來介紹一下 他是根島由佳吏 那個
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.92,0:04:04.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是莉莉寶貝的男友寶貝嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.39,0:04:07.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是的 他只是我的政府通知對像而已
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.93,0:04:09.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有什麼區別嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.47,0:04:11.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很有區別啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.35,0:04:13.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.31,0:04:18.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,總覺得 你還真是不起眼呢 這是在誇獎你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.73,0:04:20.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是誇獎嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.15,0:04:25.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.93,0:04:26.93,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,請看這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.66,0:04:28.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.08,0:04:31.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你來了啊 謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.54,0:04:33.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那當然了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.08,0:04:34.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你演的話劇很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.79,0:04:36.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我十分感動呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.96,0:04:39.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在話劇社的朋友也一直在誇獎你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.84,0:04:42.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,讚不絕口呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.38,0:04:43.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.30,0:04:46.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我 我也看了 很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.55,0:04:48.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我在舞台上看見你了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.97,0:04:52.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個 真的很漂亮 我很震撼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.14,0:04:55.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就像是換了一個人一樣耀眼奪目
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.52,0:04:59.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是 高崎同學一直都很耀眼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.77,0:05:02.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼說呢 就是 很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.11,0:05:04.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就像馬上會消失一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.78,0:05:09.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個 高崎同學
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.24,0:05:10.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 高崎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.62,0:05:13.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你別一個人偷偷逃跑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.45,0:05:15.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什麼啊 你來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.71,0:05:19.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哎呀 茱麗葉是男孩子演的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.42,0:05:23.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我沒發現呢 真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.72,0:05:27.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個 莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.26,0:05:30.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這個男孩子是仁阪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.60,0:05:34.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不會吧 是那個變態
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.68,0:05:35.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是處女吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.85,0:05:37.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,別那麼大聲叫我變態
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.77,0:05:38.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.94,0:05:41.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.44,0:05:43.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,果然你是自願打扮成這樣的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.23,0:05:46.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那怎麼可能啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.32,0:05:54.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的是悠介啊 真的是他啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.79,0:05:58.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你來幹什麼 笨蛋哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.29,0:06:02.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我來看話劇啊 然後我就看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.84,0:06:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,滾回去吧 去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.72,0:06:05.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,悠介
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.55,0:06:06.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.80,0:06:08.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,話劇很棒哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.65,0:06:12.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,讓我想起你媽媽年輕的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.60,0:06:14.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.01,0:06:17.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對了 根倉...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.02,0:06:17.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我叫根島
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.81,0:06:19.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對 根島同學
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.81,0:06:23.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我聽說你之前帶著悠介去露營了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.69,0:06:24.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.86,0:06:27.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我都不知道 謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.07,0:06:32.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不用 其實是我非要拉著他去的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.87,0:06:37.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對了 根島同學 你要不要來參加婚禮呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.58,0:06:41.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其他一起露營的朋友們也可以一起來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.38,0:06:46.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好啊好啊 歡迎你們哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.96,0:06:49.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下周是遙一的婚禮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.01,0:06:52.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是表哥一家有事來不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.84,0:06:56.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就當是作為你們帶悠介去露營的謝禮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.76,0:06:59.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也不需要隨禮了 可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.27,0:07:02.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我倒是無所謂
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.90,0:07:04.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,婚禮？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.40,0:07:06.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我們也可以去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.07,0:07:10.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那當然了 漂亮姑娘越多越好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.24,0:07:13.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,悠介也可以身成這樣來參加的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.74,0:07:14.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我才不會去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.41,0:07:19.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那你沒有問美咲她的聯繫方式嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.46,0:07:23.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一直忙著幫忙收拾東西 沒有機會問
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.17,0:07:26.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且高崎同學好像也很忙的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.96,0:07:28.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈也沒有問到嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.05,0:07:33.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我們倆和有紗三個人一直在聊話劇的話題
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.05,0:07:36.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是我太不小心了 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.85,0:07:40.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沒關係的 等去學校了 我再問她也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.02,0:07:42.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,謝謝你今天能過來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.23,0:07:45.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 我才要謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.90,0:07:47.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那麼 晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.78,0:07:49.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.57,0:07:56.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雖然總算是從高崎同學那裡打聽到了聯繫方式
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.87,0:08:00.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是突然要我給女孩子發消息 好緊張啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.08,0:08:04.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,話說回來我要怎麼寫信息呢 怎麼說才好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.73,0:08:07.48,Sub,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你好\N我是初中三年級時和你同班的根島\N突然冒昧打擾了\N我有事想問你\N就去打聽了你的聯繫方式
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.48,0:08:11.86,Sub,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你好 我是根島\N我想問一下之前你告訴我的那件事\N突然聯繫你 十分抱歉\N我等你的回復
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.79,0:08:07.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,之前已經見過了這樣會顯得很刻意吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.38,0:08:10.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好像寫得太嚴肅了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.30,0:08:12.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果是我的話可能就不會回復了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.76,0:08:14.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但對方怎麼說也是五十嵐同學
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.84,0:08:17.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還是應該禮貌一點比較好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.26,0:08:20.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 就這麼發出去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.60,0:08:22.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,發送 要發送了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.45,0:08:39.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真田同學 第五題你是怎麼做的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.54,0:08:43.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是 是微分法的那道題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.08,0:08:45.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那裡是這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.75,0:08:51.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沒想到還會有人主動和我搭話 嚇了一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.99,0:08:54.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有這麼稀奇嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.17,0:08:58.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊 至今為止從來沒發生過這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.72,0:09:01.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不過 之前去文化祭的時候我就在想
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:05.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉親你的表情之類的和從前完全不一樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.64,0:09:07.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.56,0:09:08.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.15,0:09:11.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,之前你總是面無表情呢 真田莉莉奈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.53,0:09:14.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果現在你仍然是那個面無表情的絛蟲
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.24,0:09:18.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也不會想要和你搭話了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.57,0:09:28.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我確實不像仁阪那樣是個帥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.96,0:09:30.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在班裡也毫不起眼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.67,0:09:33.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道她對我沒什麼好感
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.38,0:09:35.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但她有那麼討厭我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.92,0:09:37.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是因為我總是喜歡說古墳的話題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.80,0:09:39.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還是因為我老是在做古墳模型
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.43,0:09:41.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,話說我現在就在做啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.22,0:09:43.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是我並沒有給任何人添麻煩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.35,0:09:45.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是上圓下方墳呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.45,0:09:49.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈 你知道嗎 上圓下方墳
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.81,0:09:52.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,現在不要談上圓下方墳的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.65,0:09:54.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不是說你發出的好友申請被拒絕了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.44,0:09:58.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你打電話來的時候像是要死了一樣 嚇了我一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.24,0:10:01.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是做了什麼壞事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.33,0:10:06.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我一直覺得我的初中生活就像路邊雜草一樣不起眼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.54,0:10:09.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到底是哪裡讓她討厭我了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.88,0:10:13.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,既然如此 那就只有我去加她好友了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.67,0:10:15.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.67,0:10:18.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就連我這個同伴同學都被拒絕了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.05,0:10:19.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你也一定會被拒絕的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.22,0:10:22.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她回復我了 叫我明天來學校一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.55,0:10:24.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,為 為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.72,0:10:26.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我有那麼惹人討厭嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.06,0:10:28.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她說由佳吏也可以來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.64,0:10:29.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可以去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.94,0:10:32.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 我剛剛直接跟她回復了會去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.31,0:10:35.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還沒問你明天有沒有空
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.86,0:10:37.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沒事 我有空
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.20,0:10:41.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嗎 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.20,0:10:45.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不好意思今天忽然把你叫出來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.08,0:10:47.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,謝謝你能來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.00,0:10:49.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼突然這麼正式
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.00,0:10:52.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,現在一切都毫無進展
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.25,0:10:53.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,明天才是正式的開始呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.67,0:10:54.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你明白嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.84,0:10:56.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我明白的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.30,0:11:02.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這個學校裡的學生 成績都很好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.09,0:11:05.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嗎 也就和我們學校差不多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.35,0:11:07.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沒什麼大不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.64,0:11:09.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沒什麼大不了...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.81,0:11:12.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,話說回來 我昨天發現了一個很厲害的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.60,0:11:14.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,姻緣世代的記事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.48,0:11:15.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你仔細看
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.69,0:11:21.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,五十嵐 這是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.57,0:11:22.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.66,0:11:26.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,政府通知的發起人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.37,0:11:30.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這兩者之間不可能毫無關係吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.38,0:11:44.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我 我問你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.22,0:11:46.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你說美咲才是真正命中注定的對象 是什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.97,0:11:48.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,突然就直奔主題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.76,0:11:51.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈 別一上來就說這個啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.98,0:11:57.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這裡說話不方便 可以換個地方嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.32,0:12:03.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這裡是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.20,0:12:06.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,為什麼是貓咪咖啡店
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.03,0:12:08.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,話說都已經和貓咪玩了起來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.79,0:12:12.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是說要換個地方談嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.87,0:12:15.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼辦 我得說點什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.33,0:12:19.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,話說回來 我也給五十嵐同學發送了好友申請呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.34,0:12:23.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好像系統出錯把我拉黑了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.05,0:12:26.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是我拉黑的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.30,0:12:28.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,並不是系統的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.73,0:12:32.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼這樣 她原來這麼討厭我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.41,0:12:38.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我說 本來由佳吏的政府通知對像其實是美咲嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.15,0:12:38.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我保持沉默
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.35,0:12:42.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你也支持由佳吏和美咲的戀愛嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.90,0:12:46.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 也不算是支持 應該說完全不
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.74,0:12:50.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那你的目的到底是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:54.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就像我之前說的一樣 為了保護美咲
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.16,0:12:56.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,保護美咲
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.17,0:12:58.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也有問題要問你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.21,0:13:00.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是怎麼回事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.50,0:13:03.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是根島由佳吏的對象吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.88,0:13:05.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我那是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.97,0:13:11.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,聽了由佳吏和美咲戀愛的故事覺得很美好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.85,0:13:13.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想知道更多
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.93,0:13:17.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在和他們兩人相遇之前我從未有過這樣心跳加速的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.10,0:13:20.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,意思就是你覺得很刺激嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.11,0:13:22.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是的 我只是想要支持他們兩個
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.28,0:13:28.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是把將來要結婚的對象讓給別人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.16,0:13:30.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你又能得到什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.16,0:13:35.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我希望你不要再做這衝動的事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.16,0:13:38.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而傷害到美咲喵
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.67,0:13:41.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我怎麼會傷害她
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.96,0:13:44.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 你既然完全不支持我們
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.84,0:13:49.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,為什麼還要告訴我高崎同學才是我的命運之人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.34,0:13:57.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因為你和美咲之間有著比政府通知更重要的聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.94,0:13:59.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,更重要的聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.27,0:14:03.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我原來是很討厭高崎美咲的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.86,0:14:07.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,美咲一直是班級的中心人物非常有人氣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.32,0:14:10.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我卻不知為何 不喜歡她
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.68,0:14:11.68,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學也知道嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.10,0:14:13.14,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 我知道哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.31,0:14:14.26,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,最近很流行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.39,0:14:15.77,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,實奈也迷上了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.87,0:14:16.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她的笑容總是淺 像是不想要人看穿內心一般
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.33,0:14:20.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,明明大家都把她當朋友看待
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.46,0:14:26.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,比我的面無表情更讓人厭惡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.05,0:14:33.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看別人班級的照片幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.35,0:14:35.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,五十嵐同學
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.35,0:14:37.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你掉了什麼哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.10,0:14:42.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要買嗎 其他班的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.40,0:14:47.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,5號 12號 21號 32號
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.86,0:14:50.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這裡面都有同一個人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.16,0:14:53.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,名字 田島由佳吏嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.62,0:14:54.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是根島由佳吏
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.04,0:14:59.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你為什麼要買這個根島由佳吏的照片啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.00,0:15:05.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,難道你喜歡他嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.21,0:15:09.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不要告訴別人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.72,0:15:14.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不寫名字嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.93,0:15:19.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我沒有勇氣寫 又不是一個班的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.68,0:15:22.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那我幫你寫吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.85,0:15:23.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.85,0:15:25.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我無所謂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.02,0:15:29.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,謝謝你 五十嵐同學
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.32,0:15:32.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,叫我柊就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.20,0:15:35.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道了 謝謝你 柊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.41,0:15:42.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是我第一次見到真正的高崎美咲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.92,0:15:46.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,謝謝 用完之後我馬上還給你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.80,0:15:51.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,教科書直接跟隔壁班借就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.63,0:15:54.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,為什麼要特地跑來3班
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.18,0:15:57.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,難道是因為根島由佳吏
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.89,0:16:00.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原來真是因為他啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.31,0:16:03.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可惜他不在教室
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.74,0:16:04.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟蹤狂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.56,0:16:07.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我這樣果然很噁心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.98,0:16:08.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,開玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.07,0:16:11.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是的 別逗我開心了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.61,0:16:14.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我說 竹田 下次一起去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.92,0:16:27.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我說 根島由佳吏到底哪裡好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.25,0:16:32.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因為你說他好我就嘗試著找他的優點
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.30,0:16:35.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但他沒自信又不可靠
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.97,0:16:39.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,總是在角落笑瞇瞇和朋友講話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.01,0:16:42.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也不是想讓你瞭解
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.23,0:16:46.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就算說出來之後別人也只覺得不過如此
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.98,0:16:50.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以即使沒人理解也沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.57,0:16:56.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這是屬於我自己的最重要的心意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.66,0:17:02.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 我想要根島同學的政府通知對像明白
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.33,0:17:05.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有沒有可以告訴她的方法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.92,0:17:09.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,給她匿名寫信怎樣 好像也有點可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.25,0:17:11.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,為什麼要做到這一步
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.09,0:17:17.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因為我希望和根島同學結婚的人明白他所有的優點
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.64,0:17:22.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,希望她可以喜歡上根島同學的全部
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.18,0:17:27.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不明白 這樣美咲你能得到什麼好處
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.27,0:17:32.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和好處這些無關
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.44,0:17:33.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,話雖如此
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.11,0:17:38.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,萬一根島由佳吏的政府通知對象是你怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.37,0:17:43.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我會喜極而泣的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.83,0:17:48.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我覺得戀愛真的很美好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.12,0:17:53.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能讓一個人變得如此閃耀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.17,0:17:59.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不過 對方居然是根島由佳吏這點我始終無法接受
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.68,0:18:05.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我說 政府通知的發起人五十嵐椋是你什麼人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.47,0:18:06.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是我的奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.93,0:18:07.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.77,0:18:10.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是我的奶奶創造了政府通知
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.36,0:18:15.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,政府通知是能夠決定一個人命運之人的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.61,0:18:17.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和這個人相遇之後
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.57,0:18:22.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,至今為止的戀愛都會變得謊言一般
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.03,0:18:24.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我奶奶是這樣說的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.16,0:18:28.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是說我和莉莉奈也是命中注定之人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.25,0:18:32.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 你在說什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.92,0:18:36.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 這個只是假設 我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.43,0:18:43.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你自己是怎麼看待政府通知的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.51,0:18:46.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,老實說 我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.81,0:18:51.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 如果能通過政府通知和自己命中注定至人相遇的話
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.98,0:18:55.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也想要知道那是怎樣的一種心情
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.94,0:19:00.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果能像美咲那閃耀的戀愛一般
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.91,0:19:04.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以我想要保護美咲
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.33,0:19:06.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且我也想讓你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.95,0:19:09.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,誰是你真正的命運之人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.58,0:19:13.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,剛才聽你說了半天
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.54,0:19:14.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你到底想要幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.88,0:19:15.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,矢島先生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.05,0:19:18.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,矢島 這和你無關吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.42,0:19:23.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 怎麼可能無關 這兩人是我負責的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.47,0:19:27.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,根島由佳吏的對象就是真田莉莉奈
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.81,0:19:30.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,演算的過程也毫無問題
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.81,0:19:32.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不要胡說八道 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.98,0:19:34.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我才沒有胡說八道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.44,0:19:37.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且 你剛才說的話也是亂七八糟
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.36,0:19:40.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你把高崎那美好的戀愛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.40,0:19:45.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和政府通知的戀愛都說成是命中注定的戀愛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.49,0:19:47.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,聽好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.66,0:19:51.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自然而然喜歡上的對象和政府通知的對象是不能混為一談的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.54,0:19:56.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你自己也沒有戀愛經驗 就不要信口開河
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.54,0:20:00.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,說到底 你只是想要幫那個叫美咲的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.71,0:20:02.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是卻不知道怎麼辦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.05,0:20:08.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,總之 請你不要用你那暖味的想法去誤導他們
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.22,0:20:11.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,會很麻煩的 明白嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.64,0:20:19.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的確不應該對沒有打算選擇美咲的人說這些
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.82,0:20:22.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,美咲有我保護就夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.65,0:20:25.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以今天聽到的話 都忘了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.61,0:20:26.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.66,0:20:30.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,矢島 我不會告訴別人你今天偷偷來這裡的事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.08,0:20:33.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以把我們的賬給結了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.71,0:20:36.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 等等 柊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.42,0:20:37.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.96,0:20:40.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,搞什麼啊 那傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.34,0:20:43.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,矢島先生認識她嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.59,0:20:47.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 她好像有什麼親戚是政府高官吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.43,0:20:49.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,經常在厚勞省出入
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.22,0:20:51.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因為她很聰明
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.14,0:20:56.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,將來好像會接手政府通知的演算程序員
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.69,0:20:57.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,政府通知的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.27,0:21:02.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不過 當了程序員也並不意味著能隨意改動他人的結婚對像
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.07,0:21:09.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿基 你到底去哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.74,0:21:12.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,工作都還沒幹完
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.29,0:21:13.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.54,0:21:17.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我們也回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.80,0:21:28.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由佳吏也打算選擇美咲嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.89,0:21:36.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想要支持你和美咲的想法是不是太單純了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.90,0:21:38.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.90,0:21:44.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是我 喜歡你種直率的性格
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.70,0:21:47.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.34,0:22:26.12,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,さっきの言葉はまだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.12,0:22:28.65,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,I can't say I want to say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.65,0:22:30.73,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,言えないままでしまってる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.73,0:22:33.01,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,I always lie
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.01,0:22:35.30,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,星の瞬きほど早く
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.30,0:22:37.73,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,願い事するひまも無く
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.73,0:22:39.87,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,短い夏が終わってく
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.87,0:22:42.69,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,I can't say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.69,0:22:45.58,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Heart beat sound
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.58,0:22:51.58,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,気づかないでいてね高鳴る鼓動
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.58,0:22:55.54,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Can't keep it to myself
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.54,0:22:58.39,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自然にこぼれたはにかむ顔が
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.39,0:23:04.72,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,隠せないメッセージ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.72,0:23:06.55,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,I know why I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.55,0:23:09.01,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,未来を重ねた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.01,0:23:13.71,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,二人の温もりが ここに残ってる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.71,0:23:15.71,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,ありふれた日々に
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.71,0:23:18.31,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,はじまりのキスを
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.31,0:23:33.86,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,ひとりの夜は 君の夢を見てた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.47,0:23:37.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是電影 戀愛和謊言中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.02,0:23:41.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,擔任主演的仁阪葵的森川|葵
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.64,0:23:44.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下集 即使是謊言也無所謂 敬請期待
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:01:01.91,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}畫下等待的長線 這是心中小小的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.92,0:01:08.25,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}我們的未來 到底會走向何方呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.75,0:01:15.22,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}畫下連續的長線 接下來的旅途必定也耀眼奪目吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.34,0:01:20.68,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}就這樣 連接上心的旋律
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:28.19,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}悲傷 悲傷 悲傷和悲傷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.02,0:01:34.90,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}快樂 快樂 快樂和快樂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.70,0:01:41.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}把兩份感傷的心疊放在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.29,0:01:49.06,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}看不清的未來裡誰才是該出場的配角
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.41,0:01:56.42,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}就這樣下去 即使是謊言也讓我把這美夢做完吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.42,0:02:02.01,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}悲傷地 悲傷地 現在就去尋找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.31,0:02:09.73,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}我們相信著看不見的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.94,0:02:15.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}悲傷地 悲傷地 去尋找著
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.49,0:02:16.63,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}現在就去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.34,0:22:26.12,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,剛才想說的話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.65,0:22:30.73,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還沒能說出口
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.01,0:22:35.30,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,時間轉瞬即逝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.30,0:22:37.73,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,無暇許下心願
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.73,0:22:39.87,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,短暫夏日就此結束
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.58,0:22:51.58,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,別讓他發現 心聲難以克制
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.54,0:22:58.39,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自然流露的靦腆表情
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.39,0:23:04.72,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,掩藏不住心意
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.55,0:23:09.01,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,兩人的溫度
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.01,0:23:13.71,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,歷經歲月 停留在此
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.71,0:23:15.71,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在平淡的日子裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.71,0:23:18.31,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,時常回想起我們第一次的吻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.31,0:23:33.86,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,孤獨的夜裡 在夢中與你相會
